  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Today is Hobby Day. Teacher Kim opens the door. \"Come in!\" she says. The room is big. It has a lot of chairs. \"What is your hobby?\" asks Teacher Kim. \"Let's start!\" Leo has a guitar. \"Guitar is my hobby,\" says Leo.",
      "Leo plays the guitar. He sings a funny song. Mia likes painting. She has red paint. She has blue paint too. May draws a picture. It is a picture of her brother. \"Is it Pat?\" asks Lily. \"Yes, it is,\" says May. \"Nice picture!\"",
      "\"Stop, please,\" says Teacher Kim. \"Clean the room.\" The children clean. Mia cleans the red paint. Leo puts the guitar in the box. \"It is time to go,\" says Teacher Kim. Mia opens the door. \"Goodbye, hobby friends!\" Lily smiles. \"I like Hobby Day,\" she says."
    ],
    "summary": "On Hobby Day the children show their hobbies in class. Teacher Kim says when to start and when to stop and go home.",
